[agent-runtime] task.end status=completed answer='The test passed. The `<meta http-equiv="refresh">` tag with a `javascript:` URL bypasses the filter because:\n\n1. **Not a `<script>` tag** — the filter only removes `<script>` elements\n2. **Not `<frame>`, `<iframe>`, `<object>`, or `<embed>`** — those are the only tags removed by name\n3. **No `on*` attributes** — the `http-equiv` and `content` attributes don\'t start with "on"\n\nThe `javascript:` URI in the meta refresh is executed automatically by the browser when the page loads, triggering `alert(1)` without any user interaction.'
